# starling-quantize recipe: Qwen3-ASR-1.7B, phone "quality" (1835 MB).
# Encoder and projector Q8_0, decoder Q6_K, tied embedding/lm_head Q8_0.
# ~1487 MB read per decoded token.
#
# Measured (2026-10-12, FLEURS test, 100 clips per language, paired bootstrap
# vs all-Q8_0): en 3.77 % vs 3.91 % (clip -0.10 pt [-0.52, +0.24]), de 3.61 %
# vs 3.91 % (-0.20 pt [-0.55, +0.13]). Matrix and gate: docs/quantization.md,
# "Phone recipes".
#
#   build/starling-quantize --input models/qwen3-asr-1.7b-bf16-exact.gguf \
#       --output models/qwen3-asr-1.7b-k6x8e8.gguf \
#       --recipe quants/recipes/qwen3-1.7b-k6x8e8.recipe \
#       --imatrix models/qwen3-calib160.imx
default q8_0
^llm\.embed\.weight$ q8_0
^llm\.blk\. q6_k
